  {
    "directory": "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14093719",
    "question": {
      "math_academy_id": "q-131720",
      "knowledge_point_id": "f9469d5c-e097-590c-8ddb-2c7fda353fac",
      "knowledge_point": "Classifying a System as Consistent Dependent, Consistent Independent, or Inconsistent",
      "problem": "Consider the following system of equations.\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned} & 2x-6y-2z=4 \\\\  & 3x-9y-3z=6\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nI. The system is consistent independent\n\nII. The system has no solution\n\nIII. The system is consistent dependent",
      "worked_solution": "To classify the system, we first need to find its solution. The augmented matrix for this system is\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}2 & -6 & -2 & 4 \\\\ 3 & -9 & -3 & 6\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nUsing the method of Gaussian elimination, we can reduce this matrix to row echelon form as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =[\\begin{aligned}2 & -6 & -2 & 4 \\\\ 3 & -9 & -3 & 6\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{1} & :=\\frac{1}{2}{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -3 & -1 & 2 \\\\ 3 & -9 & -3 & 6\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}-3{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -3 & -1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe basic variables are the variables whose coefficients are pivots. In this case, the basic variable is $x,$ and we have two free variables, $y$ and $z.$ That means we can find $x$ in terms of $y$ and $z.$ \n\nTherefore, since there are infinitely many solutions, we conclude that the system is *consistent dependent*. \n\nAs a result, only statement III is true.",
      "answer_fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices_complete": true,
          "choices": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "III only",
              "option": "0",
              "source_option": "a"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "None",
              "option": "1",
              "source_option": "b"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "II only",
              "option": "2",
              "source_option": "c"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "I only",
              "option": "3",
              "source_option": "d"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "II and III only",
              "option": "4",
              "source_option": "e"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "source_answer_policy": {
